  "statement_html": "<div class=\"wims_instruction\"><img style=\"float:left;width:20px;height:20px;\" src=\"/api/static/gifs/calculator_not.svg\" alt=\"Calculatrices interdites\" ><strong>La calculatrice n'est pas autorisée, ni le brouillon.</strong>\t<br><u>Aide à la saisie :</u> saisir 3/4 pour \\(\\frac{3}{4}\\) et de préférence saisir 1.3 pour 1,3.</div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply1\">Question 1:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Lou a \\(8\\) billes. Elle a \\(6\\) fois moins de billes que Julien. Julien a\t    <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply1\" data-size=\"6\"></span> billes.   </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply2\">Question 2:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Complète : \\(3 \\times {}\\)\t    <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply2\" data-size=\"6\"></span> \\({}=12\\).   </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply3\">Question 3:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Convertir &#58; \\(4000\\) m=\t    <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply3\" data-size=\"6\"></span> km   </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply4\">Question 4:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Ecrire en chiffres, le nombre sept-millions-soixante-cinq-mille :\t    <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply4\" data-size=\"6\"></span>    </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply5\">Question 5:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  <table><tr><td><span class=\"pax-fig-group\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"300\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 100\"><line x1=\"6.52\" y1=\"94.12\" x2=\"6.52\" y2=\"5.88\" stroke=\"#bebebe\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"39.13\" y1=\"94.12\" x2=\"39.13\" y2=\"5.88\" stroke=\"#bebebe\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"71.74\" y1=\"94.12\" x2=\"71.74\" y2=\"5.88\" stroke=\"#bebebe\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"104.35\" y1=\"94.12\" x2=\"104.35\" y2=\"5.88\" stroke=\"#bebebe\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"136.96\" y1=\"94.12\" x2=\"136.96\" y2=\"5.88\" stroke=\"#bebebe\" stroke-width=\"1.0\